<title>USA: Lehighton Area Schools, Pa., won by PNC Capital.</title>
<headline>Lehighton Area Schools, Pa., won by PNC Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital Markets said it won $4.995 million of Lehighton Area School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.8135 percent.</p>
</text>
